    "message": "Accept frozen event values when events are rebuilt or copied\n\nEvent payloads and provenance are frozen into mappingproxy objects.\nThree paths failed on them:\n\n- A delayed delivery rebuilt its ledger event with nested frozen\n  provenance, which the JSON check rejected and stopped the run (#76).\n- A deferred departure did the same, so nobody left (#78). Its retry\n  count was also read through a dict check that never matched, so the\n  one-day retry bound never applied.\n- move_facility deep-copied the frozen target point, so the move\n  always failed (#82).\n\nScheduledEvent now accepts Mapping values in what it is given and\ncopies them, the retry reads its provenance as a Mapping, and\nmove_facility stores the validated point. The three intervention tests\nno longer expect failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
